<view class="login-page"><view class="login-decor decor-one"></view><view class="login-decor decor-two"></view><view class="login-brand"><view class="login-logo">启</view><text>启晨教育</text><text class="login-slogan">让每一次学习都有回响</text></view><view class="login-panel"><text class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO QICHEN</text><text class="login-title">从今天开始，向前一点点。</text><text class="sub">登录后查看课表、提交请假、完成同步练习，并与小启助手一起学习。</text><view class="agreement-row"><checkbox-group bindchange="onAgreementChange"><label class="agreement-check"><checkbox value="agreed" color="#255e4f"/><text>我已阅读并同意</text></label></checkbox-group><text class="agreement-link" catchtap="openAgreement">《用户协议》</text><text>和</text><text class="agreement-link" catchtap="openPrivacy">《隐私政策》</text></view><view class="avatar-choice"><checkbox-group bindchange="onProfileChoice"><label><checkbox value="profile" checked="{{useWechatProfile}}" color="#255e4f"/><text>登录后使用我的微信头像和昵称（可在资料页替换）</text></label></checkbox-group><text class="choice-tip">不勾选将自动生成随机名称和头像</text></view><button class="wechat-login" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="onLogin">{{loading?'正在登录…':'微信一键登录'}}</button><button class="guest-login" bindtap="onExperience">暂不登录，先体验</button><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="login-error">{{error}}</text></view></view>
